        "    $\\Xmat_{\\texttt{system-message}}$  \\PredSty{\\texttt{<STOP>}} \\\\\n",
        "    $\\texttt{Human}: \\Xmat_{\\texttt{instruct}}^1$  \\PredSty{\\texttt{<STOP>}}\n",
